WEBVTT

00:13:27.276 --> 00:13:30.612
Tuna nafasi ya watu kuwasha mshumaa

00:13:30.612 --> 00:13:33.014
wanaposhukuru kwa jambo fulani.

00:13:33.014 --> 00:13:38.342
Na kuna mishumaa milioni 15 inayowashwa

00:13:38.342 --> 00:13:40.072
katika muongo mmoja.

00:13:40.072 --> 00:13:42.782
Watu wanaanza kutambua

00:13:42.782 --> 00:13:46.206
dunia ya shukrani ni dunia yenye furaha,

00:13:46.206 --> 00:13:49.168
na wote tuna nafasi

00:13:49.168 --> 00:13:52.323
kwa njia rahisi ya simama,angalia,nenda,

00:13:52.323 --> 00:13:54.363
kubadilisha dunia,

00:13:54.363 --> 00:13:56.059
kuifanya sehemu ya furaha.

00:13:56.059 --> 00:13:57.544
Na hilo ndo ninalotumaini kwetu,

00:13:57.544 --> 00:14:00.178
na kama hili linachangia kidogo